.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-apple-brew-install 1  "stool-apple-brew-install "
.SH NAME
stool\-apple\-brew\-install \- Ensure Homebrew is available, then install a trusted Brewfile without routine upgrades
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-apple\-brew\-install\fR [\fB\-\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ensure Homebrew is available, then install a trusted Brewfile without routine upgrades
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Trusted Brewfile to install (defaults to ~/.Brewfile)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show the plan without downloading, installing or evaluating the Brewfile
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Run without terminal input (requires privileges to be prepared separately)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
